r  meyer is going to third so that means he  better make it home he does so wendell  and zanino have scored the runs first  and third and one out it's two nothing  rays looking for more and here's brandon  lau  that's the other way into left  grossman is there to make the catch tag  and kiermeier  will score  walls remains at first and the rays pick  up  another run  it's a three-run inning  lao  collecting his 83rd run batted in  upright stands hands are tight by the  left shoulder as he [ __ ] the bat over  it 3-2 swinging a fly ball left field  deep on the run grossman tracking it  he'll make the catch  running to the left field corner  long inning for casey my seven men to  the plate a lot of pitches thrown  meadows finally flies out to ending  pitch and change brian garcia takes over  for casey mize mine's just two innings  of work three runs three hits a couple  of strikeouts 48 pitches for casey mize  rosarina ground ball up the middle  backhanded by willy castro from shallow  left throws to first and he got him fine  play  willy castro ended up way over in shadow  left field  range far to his right got a lot on the  throw the best play we've seen him make  all year you talk about the art of  fielding there it was as good as you  will see at the big leagues joey wendell  at the plate  that's a well tagged ball into deep  right center reyes will turn around and  watch it sail  home run for joey wendell his tenth of  the year  joey wendell now with a triple and a  home run and boy did he  lay into that one  four-nothing  rays i'll tell you what when the sound  of the crack at the back is that crisp  through the tv that's all you need to  know about the contact changeup gets  laid out right out over the plate  and joey wendell didn't miss brandon  today has a run batted in on a sacrifice  fly to left field  now a base hit into center field  that will get kermeyer home  a run batted in for lau the round is  charged to garcia and the ray's building  now a five-run